# Cursor Rules

The project instructions and universal standards are defined in:

@AGENTS.md
@agents_project.md

`AGENTS.md` (and the optional `agents_project.md` if present in the repository root) define the single
source of truth for architecture, coding conventions, development workflow, resource disposal, verification
pipeline, and testing rules. Follow them before making any changes.

Do not introduce Cursor-specific overrides unless explicitly required.
